  "source_image_sha256": "588b4288e4c737dc489d2b9bc0652cca85e3d668b1784942ef4b4bda916f1005",
  "scenes": [
    {
      "chapter": 209,
      "source": "ADV/DAT/CHAPTER209.YBC",
      "sha256": "c2f9df8c81eba40b8783e7f153820aa81b3270906ddd9c2080a54f775ebfecc8",
      "text_count": 75,
      "pages": [
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 198,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            0
          ],
          "text": "終於……通往安蒂米昂的道路打開了嗎？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 252,
          "speaker_id": 110,
          "speaker": "帕佩修",
          "text_indices": [
            1,
            2,
            3
          ],
          "text": "……如果錯失了這次機會，\n也許就再也沒有辦法回去了呢。\n雖然現在要反攻過去也十分地困難。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 274,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            4
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 312,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            5
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 334,
          "speaker_id": 110,
          "speaker": "帕佩修",
          "text_indices": [
            6
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 356,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            7
          ],
          "text": "他的情況怎麼樣了呢……？"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 388,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            8,
            9
          ],
          "text": "「總有一天，我們會沒有辦法再固守不出。\n我們不能再這樣一直拖延下去。」"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 410,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            10
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 432,
          "speaker_id": 110,
          "speaker": "帕佩修",
          "text_indices": [
            11
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 458,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            12
          ],
          "text": "那位先生一邊這麼說，卻一邊垂下了雙眼……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 484,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            13
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 516,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            14,
            15
          ],
          "text": "「孩子們正這麼希望著。\n他們正用那澄澈的眼神這樣地盼望著。」"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 542,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            16
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 586,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            17,
            18,
            19,
            20
          ],
          "text": "「雖然如此，要回應那一份思念的同時，\n卻也會讓他們遭受苦難……\n這是我不能接受的。」\n他給我的感覺是這樣的……"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 624,
          "speaker_id": 110,
          "speaker": "帕佩修",
          "text_indices": [
            21,
            22,
            23
          ],
          "text": "……真的都沒變呢。\n羽翼之長的愛徒們，\n今天也與那別離的雨夜裡一樣。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 646,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            24
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 686,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            25,
            26,
            27,
            28
          ],
          "text": "充滿奧爾菲思念的書信……\n把他召喚回來了嗎。\n這還真不知道是喜是憂啊。\n這一切，真的是罪孽深重哪。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 712,
          "speaker_id": 110,
          "speaker": "帕佩修",
          "text_indices": [
            29
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 734,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            30
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 756,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            31
          ],
          "text": "不是這樣的。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 782,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            32
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 820,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            33,
            34,
            35
          ],
          "text": "雖然踏上了與大家分離的旅程，\n但就因為有著對奧爾菲學長的掛念，\n他才能夠有不斷前進的毅力吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 846,
          "speaker_id": 110,
          "speaker": "帕佩修",
          "text_indices": [
            36
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 878,
          "speaker_id": 115,
          "speaker": "薛莉爾",
          "text_indices": [
            37,
            38
          ],
          "text": "那就是純潔之盾所選擇的道路，\n就是孩子們決定了要前進的方向呀。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 904,
          "speaker_id": 101,
          "speaker": "德涅西亞",
          "text_indices": [
            39
          ],
          "text": "是這樣嗎……那就這樣吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 1026,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            40,
            41,
            42,
            43,
            44
          ],
          "text": "各位能夠像現在這樣地挺身而出，\n真是令人開心。\n為了保護我們的故鄉，\n就算這一點點努力微不足道……\n我們也要把這份心意展現出來。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 1084,
          "speaker_id": 3,
          "speaker": "帕彌菈",
          "text_indices": [
            45
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 1102,
          "speaker_id": 8,
          "speaker": "奎絲忒",
          "text_indices": [
            46
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 1128,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            47
          ],
          "text": "曾經有人這麼說。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 1206,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            48
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 1224,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            49
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 1268,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            50,
            51,
            52,
            53
          ],
          "text": "「我只希望能夠做到這件事情。\n無論面對什麼樣的人，都要用微笑去面對。」\n……無論面對什麼樣的人，\n都要用微笑去面對。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 1346,
          "speaker_id": 1,
          "speaker": "凱洛特",
          "text_indices": [
            54
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 1364,
          "speaker_id": 2,
          "speaker": "夏朧",
          "text_indices": [
            55
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 1390,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            56
          ],
          "text": "這是我的老師對我的教誨。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 1444,
          "speaker_id": 9,
          "speaker": "伊里安",
          "text_indices": [
            57
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 1476,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            58,
            59
          ],
          "text": "就像你們所希望的一樣。\n就像我所希望的一樣。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 1530,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            60
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 1556,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            61
          ],
          "text": "讓我們為愛爾梅納斯取回昔日的笑容吧。"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 1590,
          "speaker_id": 9,
          "speaker": "伊里安",
          "text_indices": [
            62
          ],
          "text": "是的！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 1612,
          "speaker_id": 268435455,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text_indices": [
            63
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 1642,
          "speaker_id": 4,
          "speaker": "瑟希莉絲",
          "text_indices": [
            64
          ],
          "text": "是的！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 1688,
          "speaker_id": 9,
          "speaker": "伊里安",
          "text_indices": [
            65
          ],
          "text": "…………"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 1714,
          "speaker_id": 5,
          "speaker": "法娜",
          "text_indices": [
            66
          ],
          "text": "是的！！"
        },
        {
          "chapter": 209,
          "source_offset": 1776,
          "speaker_id": 6,
          "speaker": "艾爾雪",
          "text_indices": [
            67
          ],
          "text": "是的！！"
        },
        {
